{"id":"cf6fbe6965e63f34","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-primitive-recursive.md","title":"原始递归函数族","display":"df-primitive-recursive — 原始递归函数族","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-primitive-recursive","aliases":["20-df-primitive-recursive"],"display":"df-primitive-recursive — 原始递归函数族","chapter":"17","section":"17.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 17.2.1","source_pdf_pages":[256],"source_printed_pages":[229],"depends_on":["[[20-df-composition]]","[[20-df-primitive-recursion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-primitive-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-primitive-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursive — 原始递归函数族"},{"key":"chapter","html":"17"},{"key":"section","html":"17.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 17.2.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>256</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>229</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6c42d8d708f182d\" href=\"?note=c6c42d8d708f182d\" title=\"20-df-composition\">20-df-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0cdf7f1474a3271f\" href=\"?note=0cdf7f1474a3271f\" title=\"20-df-primitive-recursion\">20-df-primitive-recursion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_k=\\omega^{\\omega^k}\">\\(U_k=\\omega^{\\omega^k}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}U_k\">\\(U=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}U_k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq U\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq U\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_k(\\vec x)=0\">\\(Z_k(\\vec x)=0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(x)=x+1\">\\(S(x)=x+1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^k(\\vec x)=x_i\">\\(P_i^k(\\vec x)=x_i\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span>）。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c6c42d8d708f182d\" href=\"?note=c6c42d8d708f182d\" title=\"20-df-composition\">20-df-composition</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0cdf7f1474a3271f\" href=\"?note=0cdf7f1474a3271f\" title=\"20-df-primitive-recursion\">20-df-primitive-recursion</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nB:=\\{S\\}\\cup\\{Z_k:k\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{P_i^k:k\\in\\omega,\\ i&lt;k\\},\\\\\nC(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k,m\\in\\omega\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_m\\\n\\forall(g_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in(\\mathcal F\\cap U_k)^m\\\n[\\operatorname{Comp}(h,(g_i))\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\nR(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_k\\\n\\forall h\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_{k+2}\\ [\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\n\\mathcal{PR}:=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq U:B\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land C(\\mathcal F)\\land R(\\mathcal F)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nB:=\\{S\\}\\cup\\{Z_k:k\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{P_i^k:k\\in\\omega,\\ i&lt;k\\},\\\\\nC(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k,m\\in\\omega\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_m\\\n\\forall(g_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in(\\mathcal F\\cap U_k)^m\\\n[\\operatorname{Comp}(h,(g_i))\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\nR(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_k\\\n\\forall h\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_{k+2}\\ [\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\n\\mathcal{PR}:=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq U:B\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land C(\\mathcal F)\\land R(\\mathcal F)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>交集的候选非空，因为全部有限元数全函数构成闭合族。闭包算子的元数与全定义性已在上游给出。零元函数允许常数初值；投影仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&gt;0\">\\(k&gt;0\\)</span> 时有实例。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 17.2.1；印刷页 229；PDF 第 256 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"c6c42d8d708f182d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-primitive-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"0cdf7f1474a3271f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-primitive-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"c6c42d8d708f182d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-composition]]；see [[20-df-primitive-recursion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-primitive-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"0cdf7f1474a3271f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-composition]]；see [[20-df-primitive-recursion]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U_k=\\omega^{\\omega^k}","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}U_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"Z_k(\\vec x)=0","display":false},{"tex":"S(x)=x+1","display":false},{"tex":"P_i^k(\\vec x)=x_i","display":false},{"tex":"i<k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nB:=\\{S\\}\\cup\\{Z_k:k\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{P_i^k:k\\in\\omega,\\ i<k\\},\\\\\nC(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k,m\\in\\omega\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_m\\\n\\forall(g_i)_{i<m}\\in(\\mathcal F\\cap U_k)^m\\\n[\\operatorname{Comp}(h,(g_i))\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\nR(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_k\\\n\\forall h\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_{k+2}\\ [\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\n\\mathcal{PR}:=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq U:B\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land C(\\mathcal F)\\land R(\\mathcal F)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"k>0","display":false}],"bytes":1714,"backlinks":[{"id":"a197f5a4c2eb61dc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-primitive-recursive]]；see [[20-df-composition]]；see [[20-df-primitive-recursion]]。"},{"id":"f72d107b70d58355","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-primitive-recursive]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pr]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-primitive-recursive]] — 章 17；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-primitive-recursive]]"}],"outgoing":["c6c42d8d708f182d","0cdf7f1474a3271f"]}